{"title":"소년소녀 카멜레온 심프텀","artist":"Neru","sourceId":"reference:theZ6cgdG0HU0FT2CtwS","sourceHash":"78972aaeecd8b34f81f6b05ec8355949897548994a809ccaaf0e2b70ed46f957","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":30.79,"end":33.79,"text":"埃を被った薇に 如雨露で水を注ぎましょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":35.66,"end":38.66,"text":"素敵な花 芽吹くのかな ハロー ハロー ハロー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":40.76,"end":43.76,"text":"どれだけ自分を愛せても どれだけ他人を愛せても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":45.83,"end":48.83,"text":"同じ天秤に掛けるのは ダメなのだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":51.34,"end":54.34,"text":"ヘッドフォンを レンジでチンしてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":55.34,"end":58.34,"text":"彼の顔が 見えないんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":60.42,"end":63.42,"text":"ぶつかって 転んで 膝を擦り剥いて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":65.67,"end":68.67,"text":"君達は僕を 笑うんだろ 笑うんだろ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":70.68,"end":73.68,"text":"欲しがって 奪って それでも足りなくて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":76.0,"end":79.0,"text":"僕ら 手と手 汚し合ったの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":81.84,"end":84.84,"text":"助走もつけずに三歩前 そんな急に何処へ行く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":86.0,"end":89.0,"text":"変わったのはどちらなの ハロー ハロー ハロー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":91.27,"end":94.27,"text":"ある日突然思い耽る 例えば明日死のうとして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":96.16,"end":99.16,"text":"どれほどの人が涙して くれるのだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":101.47,"end":104.47,"text":"焦げた音に 彼は聴き入っていて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":105.87,"end":108.87,"text":"こんな詩じゃ 伝わらない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":110.93,"end":113.93,"text":"いつだって 不安で 震えてるせいで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":115.9,"end":118.9,"text":"錆び付いた手首も 見ない振り 見ない振り","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":121.13,"end":124.13,"text":"そうやって 腐って この犬小屋で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":126.1,"end":129.1,"text":"僕ら 笑顔を 盗り合うんだろう ねぇ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":150.52,"end":153.52,"text":"色んな痣を隠してまで 得たものは、","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":154.32999999999998,"end":157.32999999999998,"text":"誰一人だって 欲しがりはしないような","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":159.24,"end":161.95,"text":"暗闇でした。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":161.95,"end":164.95,"text":"偽って 騙して まだまだ足りなくて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":166.81,"end":169.81,"text":"君の顔踏み 捻るんだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":170.66,"end":171.88,"text":"あぁ、そうだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":171.88,"end":174.88,"text":"どうすんだい これじゃ 何も変わらないぞ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":176.66,"end":179.66,"text":"彼に 伝えたい ことがあるのに ねぇ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}